  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 72 - 6 + 2 × 216 ÷ 24 = 420 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : × and ÷\n\n72 - 6 + 2 × 216 ÷ 24 = 420 ⇒ 72 - 6 + **2 ÷ 216**__ × 24 = 420\n\n72 - 6 + __**0.009 × 24**__ = 420\n\n__**72 + 0.216**__ - 6 = 420\n\n__**72.216 - 6**__ = 420\n\n66 ≠ 420 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : - and ×​\n\n72 - 6 + 2 × 216 ÷ 24 = 420 ⇒ 72 × 6 + 2 - **216 ÷ 24**__ = 420\n\n__**72 × 6**__ + 2 - 9 = 420\n\n__**432 + 2**__ - 9 = 420\n\n__**434 - 9**__ = 420\n\n425 ≠ 420 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : - and + \n\n72 - 6 + 2 × 216 ÷ 24 = 420 ⇒ 72 + 6 - 2 × **216 ÷ 24**__ = 420\n\n72 + 6 - __**2 × 9**__ = 420\n\n__**72 + 6**__ - 18 = 420\n\n__**78 - 18**__ = 420\n\n60 ≠ 420 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : - and ÷\n\n72 - 6 + 2 × 216 ÷ 24 = 420 ⇒ **72 ÷ 6**__ + 2 × 216 - 24 = 420\n\n12 + __**2 × 216**__ - 24 = 420\n\n__**12 + 432**__ - 24 = 420\n\n__**444 - 24**__ = 420\n\n420 = 420 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
